\nよろしくお願いします。\n\n資料\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/ubsctnx7zmaj3dc/CharaStudio-2023-03-03-05-45-41-Render.png?dl=0\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/cqkb077drgsgldg/CharaStudio-2023-03-03-05-52-49-Render.png?dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@maikeruEX/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/87b16cb4/uploads/origins/8ece4350-1c46-45e1-81dc-21a44faa79c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=413ba2523b7755bc03685aedae4c69f4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/87b16cb4/uploads/origins/8ece4350-1c46-45e1-81dc-21a44faa79c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=413ba2523b7755bc03685aedae4c69f4, https://si.imgix.net/87b16cb4/uploads/origins/8ece4350-1c46-45e1-81dc-21a44faa79c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82154e1b43a22a125cad41654adb75f1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/87b16cb4/uploads/origins/8ece4350-1c46-45e1-81dc-21a44faa79c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13535ff6ace849298b92127f07ee83a3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "妖怪少女のうらら達をよく描かれるのでリクエストします\n\nOCGの儚無みずき\n自分のことを可愛いと分かってるあざとい感じ\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/72627145", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@maikeruEX/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/38904064/uploads/origins/0896c76c-8811-4410-bb4d-f9a2f0d2ee96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06fa497bc80fc3381507e9b44894e1e8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/38904064/uploads/origins/0896c76c-8811-4410-bb4d-f9a2f0d2ee96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06fa497bc80fc3381507e9b44894e1e8, https://si.imgix.net/38904064/uploads/origins/0896c76c-8811-4410-bb4d-f9a2f0d2ee96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b44b5c3c32fe17fc5fe770d2a11baef7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/38904064/uploads/origins/0896c76c-8811-4410-b